-- The Bogden Road Country Inn's cellar, in our pieces, from the inn sheet's description: the ladder down from the
-- trapdoor behind the bar in the north-west, rows of barrels, sacks and crates along the north wall, the storm doors up
-- to the loading yard in the east, and the dark back of the cellar behind the last row of barrels, where the pack rat
-- keeps its nest (ours). North is up; the south wall is left off, the DM's side.

